{"id":18852,"author":"Dokyle","body":"\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHello I am better FanOfYazda_ Dokihl cone and this is my warning about not being cut\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eIt all begins when FrozenThorn says \"Use ./report\" \u0026nbsp;(Jajah say this too)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eAnd then I (Dokihl) said, \"Just shut up\"\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eAfter that he decided to warn as \"Polite\". (Too a kick and later my ban)\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eAnd the question I ask myself, that it was necessary to warn?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eOr tell me it is not like they tell you to keep silent in your class, home, etc ..\u003c/